      <h2>AI tools</h2>
      <p class="lede">The fastest-moving category on this page, and the one where copied lists go wrong quickest. Every offer here changed in 2026.</p>
    </div>

    <div class="callout warn">
      <span class="k">Read this before the first card</span>
      <p>Google relaunched its student offer on 19 August 2026 after the previous one closed. The new one gives U.S. students a free year of AI Pro and students in 140+ other markets a free year of AI Plus — but <strong>Canada is excluded outright</strong>, along with Albania, Bolivia, Hong Kong, Macau and Tunisia. That exclusion sits in Google's own support documentation, not in the announcement headline, which is why most roundups miss it.</p>
      <p>If you are studying in Canada, the direct route does not work. A separate Google offer distributed through Handshake did cover Canadian students, but it was described as running only through the end of summer, so treat it as expired unless your Handshake account still shows it.</p>
    </div>

