          <dt>How to claim</dt><dd>Sign in with a <em>personal</em> Google account, not your school Workspace one, then verify enrolment. Redeem by 31 December 2026.</dd>
          <dt>The catch</dt><dd class="alert">Canada, Albania, Bolivia, Hong Kong, Macau and Tunisia are excluded. A payment method is required at sign-up and the plan auto-renews at $19.99/month unless you cancel. Set the reminder now.</dd>
